  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 718.01 Required Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 718.01 Required Records. Each O/O shall:\n\n(a) Comply with the recordkeeping requirements of 40 CFR § 141.33; and\n\n(b) Maintain such additional records as are specified in subtitle Env-Dw for particular facets of PWS ownership, operation, and maintenance.\n\nSource. #10617, eff 6-1-14; ss by #12669, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
